      <!-- Hiking Tips for Allentown Area -->
      <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-emerald-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">Essential Tips for Hiking Near Allentown</h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-2xl">🚗</span> Getting There
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-stone-700">
              <li>• For Mount Tammany and the Delaware Water Gap, take I-78 E</li>
              <li>• For the central Kittatinny Ridge (Jenny Jump, Schooleys Mountain), take Route 22 E to I-80 E</li>
              <li>• For High Point and the northern ridge, continue on I-80 E to Route 23 N</li>
